sequenceDiagram
    participant M as MissionController
    participant N as NavigationMode
    participant R as NavigationRuntimeNode
    participant T as ExecutionTimelineStore
    M->>M: measured pass-through crossing + current witness
    M->>N: PublishGoal for next waypoint/request
    N->>N: retain exact old command if certified and leased
    N->>R: publish new NavigationGoal
    R->>R: set desired goal; keep executing identity if handoff not committed
    R->>T: stage successor under identity/version checks
    T->>T: activate at declared boundary
    T-->>R: execution identity cutover; consume matching pending goal
    R-->>N: new identity NavigationCommand
    Note over M,T: Distinct callbacks; no cross-process atomic transaction.
